Package: cpxy
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: ip-full, kmod-tun
Conflicts: cpxy-router
Section: net
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: cpxy-ng
Description: cpxy for OpenWrt: per network, an HTTP proxy, smartdns, LAN routing with split DNS and a Tailscale exit node
 One instance per set of networks, each with its own cpxy server: cpxy-client (HTTP proxy),
 cpxy-smartdns (overseas DNS through that proxy), cpxy-router (TCP through the server, DNS
 through dns_split) and cpxy-tsgw (Tailscale exit node). Configure /etc/config/cpxy.
 Includes smartdns (GPL-3.0-or-later); see /usr/share/doc/cpxy.
